"What is the opposite of “full”?|empty|heavy|round|clean#A full cup has lots in it. An empty cup has nothing in it.",
"What is the opposite of “wet”?|dry|warm|soft|dirty#Wet things have water on them. Dry things do not.",
"What is the opposite of “fast”?|slow|quick|loud|late#Fast and slow are opposites. Quick means the same as fast.",
