"What is a baby dog called?|puppy|kitten|calf|lamb#A baby dog is a puppy.",
"What is a baby cat called?|kitten|puppy|chick|foal#A baby cat is a kitten.",
"Which word fits? “I brush my teeth with a ___.”|toothbrush|spoon|comb|pencil#We brush our teeth with a toothbrush.",
"Which word fits? “Birds can ___ in the sky.”|fly|swim|dig|bark#Birds fly in the sky.",
"Which word fits? “I wear ___ on my feet.”|shoes|gloves|hats|scarves#Shoes go on your feet. Gloves go on your hands.",
"Who helps sick animals?|a vet|a chef|a pilot|a builder#A vet is an animal doctor.",
